        "original_id": "655184b3-e417-5171-932c-6c75dcd23ee3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Sound Team, Dead by Sunrise, Feathers\n- People: Bill Baird, Matt Oliver, Chester Bennington, Christine Aprile, Drew Citron, Alex Gehring, Jordan Johns, Jon Minor, Destiny Montague, Su Swann\n- Places: Austin, Texas\n- Topics: American bands, band formation, live lineup, former band names, associated bands\n\nFacts:\n- Sound Team was an American band based in Austin, Texas, and it formed in 2000 around principal songwriters Bill Baird and Matt Oliver.\n- Dead by Sunrise, formerly known as Snow White Tan, was an American post-grunge rock band formed in 2005 by Linkin Park lead singer Chester Bennington.\n- Feathers' live lineup has included Christine Aprile of Silent Diane, Drew Citron of Frankie Rose, Beverly, and Avan Lava, Alex Gehring of Ringo Deathstarr, Jordan Johns of Sound Team, Jon Minor, Destiny Montague of Midnight Masses and Shock Cinema, and Su Swann of Hussle Club.",
